@startuml proxy_principle
title Proxy: Принципиальная схема работы APRS-IS Proxy
left to right direction

package "Рация TD-H9 (BLE)" {
  [Radio RX\nиз эфира]
  [Radio TX\nв эфир]
}

package "TDH9RadioBridge (AprsIsProxyClient)" {
  [Local APRS-IS server\n:listenPort]
  [AIS feed server\n:aisPort]
  [Upstream connection\nserver:serverPort]
  [Callbacks & caches]
}

package "Внешнее" {
  [APRS-IS Internet Server]
  [Local APRS-IS clients\nYAAC / APRSDroid]
  [AIS clients\nOruxMaps / OpenCPN]
}

[Radio RX] --> [Callbacks & caches] : radioRx(text)
[Callbacks & caches] --> [Local APRS-IS server] : radio -> clients (qAR)
[Callbacks & caches] --> [Upstream connection] : radio -> internet (qAR)
[Callbacks & caches] --> [AIS feed server] : radio -> AIS (позиции)

[Upstream connection] --> [APRS-IS Internet Server] : user/pass/filter
[APRS-IS Internet Server] --> [Upstream connection] : пакеты
[Upstream connection] --> [Local APRS-IS server] : internet -> clients
[Upstream connection] --> [Callbacks & caches] : internet -> radio
[Upstream connection] --> [AIS feed server] : internet -> AIS (позиции)

[Local APRS-IS clients] --> [Local APRS-IS server] : login + пакеты
[Local APRS-IS server] --> [Local APRS-IS clients] : broadcast
[Local APRS-IS server] --> [Callbacks & caches] : clients -> internet (clientsToInternet)
[Local APRS-IS server] --> [Radio TX] : clients -> radio (clientsToRadio)

[AIS clients] --> [AIS feed server] : "read-only (TCP)"
[AIS feed server] --> [AIS clients] : "!AIVDM ... (тип 1-3 + 5)"

note bottom of [Callbacks & caches]
  Направления настраиваются чекбоксами Forwarding:
  radio -> internet, radio -> clients, radio -> AIS (и cache)
  internet -> radio, internet -> clients, internet -> AIS (и cache)
  clients -> radio, clients -> internet
  Upstream активен, если: есть clients, radioToInternet,
  internetToRadio или internetToAis.
end note

@enduml